usage: calibrate_rotation [-h] (--bag BAG | --csv CSV) --output OUTPUT
                          [--topic TOPIC] [--world-frame WORLD_FRAME]
                          [--body-frame BODY_FRAME] [--storage-id STORAGE_ID]
                          [--no-plot] [--start-sec START_SEC]
                          [--end-sec END_SEC] [--min-samples MIN_SAMPLES]
                          [--min-angle-deg MIN_ANGLE_DEG]
                          [--min-rate MIN_RATE] [--max-gap MAX_GAP]
                          [--max-jump MAX_JUMP]
                          [--max-condition MAX_CONDITION] [--max-rms MAX_RMS]
                          [--max-p95 MAX_P95]
                          [--max-direction-difference MAX_DIRECTION_DIFFERENCE]
                          [--max-axis-variation-deg MAX_AXIS_VARIATION_DEG]
                          [--level-tolerance-deg LEVEL_TOLERANCE_DEG]
                          [--body-z BODY_Z]

Offline fixed-centre calibration. Never creates a ROS node or publishes
motion.

options:
